cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these results, please cite the paper below."
title: "The Compression Floor: Few-Step Decoding Collapse and the Preconditions for Self-Distillation in Small Block-Diffusion Language Models"
abstract: >-
  Measurements of the cost of parallel decoding in a small block-diffusion
  language model (SDAR-4B-Chat, block sizes 16 and 32), the effect of
  supervision density in diffusion SFT, and the preconditions required for
  on-policy self-distillation to train at all at this scale.
